    "description": "Full-screen draggable title menu where dragging between large outlined titles cross-fades photo previews, and an explore button collapses scattered photos into an editorial grid layout.",
    "contents": [
        "Horizontal menu of large section titles with numbering and an explore link",
        "Scattered photo previews per section that collapse into a 9-image grid",
        "Back arrow button and custom circular cursor with drag arrows"
    ],
    "behavior": [
        "Drag horizontally to move between sections with lerped menu motion and filled-to-outline letter blending",
        "Preview images stretch, shift and fade between sections while dragging",
        "Explore expands the active section into a scrollable grid layout, back returns to the scattered preview",
        "Custom cursor scales on hover and drag, hidden on touch devices",
        "GSAP loaded by dynamic import, all listeners, frames and tweens cleaned on unmount"
